  "description": "Thierry, the young master who seems kind and foolish, yet is loaded with money. Blanche tried to swindle him by pretending to be his lover, but he ends up feeling true love from the affectionate Thierry. His fleeting desire to live an ordinary life by his side once this was overwas short-lived. \n\n *\"Congratulations, Blanche. You've become my beloved toy.\"*\n\nHe ends up imprisoned as a toy by Thierry and his identical twin brother, Ardo...\n\nThe real con artists and madmen were the two young masters.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
